      "title": "AUBANK: New Forex Remittance Push Will Support Future Re Rating",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained their price target for AU Small Finance Bank at ₹1,275, citing only marginal adjustments to the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E assumptions, rather than a fundamental change in the overall investment narrative. What's in the News AU Small Finance Bank launched a customer-centric forex proposition that removes embedded charges on international fund transfers, offering zero forex margin and zero bank charges on both inward and outward remittances, with currency conversion at the bank's Interbank Reference Rate and no hidden mark ups.",
