      "title": "AUBANK: New CFO Appointment And Stable Margins Will Support Re Rating",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged their price target for AU Small Finance Bank up from ₹1,250 to ₹1,275, reflecting updated assumptions around discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E that together support a slightly higher fair value estimate. What's in the News The board has approved the appointment of Gaurav Jain as Chief Financial Officer, effective April 27, 2026, following his service as Interim CFO since September 26, 2025 (Key Developments).",
