      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-29T11:26:31.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹35.40 (vs ₹28.32 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹35.40 (up from ₹28.32 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹104.8b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹26.4b (up 25% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 25% (up from 24% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 21% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 1.6% growth forecast for the Banks industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year and the company’s share price has also increased by 14% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4ec27b5-ea6e-4843-b5c2-6b8536aa270f",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-04-27T11:21:00.000Z",
      "title": "AU Small Finance Bank Limited Appoints Gaurav Jain as Chief Financial Officer, Effective April 27, 2026",
      "body": "AU Small Finance Bank Limited at the board meeting held on April 27, 2026 announced the appointment of Mr. Gaurav Jain as Chief Financial Officer (CFO) of the Bank with effect from April 27, 2026. Mr. Gaurav Jain was earlier appointed as Interim Chief Financial Officer of the Bank with effect from September 26, 2025. An all-India rank holder Chartered Accountant and an MBA from the Kellogg School of Management, Mr. Jain brings over two decades of distinguished global leadership experience spanning India, London, and New York. He possesses deep expertise across financial stewardship, M&A & strategic transformation, digital enablement, and governance, having held senior leadership roles at globally renowned institutions including Morgan Stanley, Lloyds Banking Group, Tech Mahindra, and PwC. ",
      "keyDevTypeId": "102",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
